      "heading": "The day's evidence",
      "id": "P002",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Two Philippine Army officers testified about certifications for 2023 youth and information activities that Dep-Ed later used in answering C O A questions about confidential funds. Both described their documents as records that Army activities occurred, not certifications of Dep-Ed spending."
    },
    {
