      "heading": "What Boransing certified",
      "id": "P004",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Boransing described Y L S as a longstanding inter-agency Army program. He testified that his division received no Dep-Ed funds for its 2023 Y L S and I E C activities. He said the certification stated no purpose, and he did not know it would be used in Dep-Ed's C O A response. It certified that the activities occurred and that the participating agencies did their part."
    },
