      "heading": "Documents and the court's correction",
      "id": "P006",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "The parties stipulated to identified C O A memoranda, Dep-Ed correspondence, A F P certifications, and related records. The chair ordered that those documents needed no further proof beyond completing the witness narration. When Robles called the questioned expenditure disallowed, the chair sustained an objection and said the record contained no evidence of a C O A disallowance."
    },
