      "heading": "Panopio's account",
      "id": "P008",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Colonel Magtangol G. Panopio testified about his December 5, 2023 certification. He said he learned during an October 2024 congressional hearing that Dep-Ed had used it as a liquidation document. That surprised him because it certified Y L S activities, not money or funds. Panopio said information from teachers could combine open-source and confidential material used to plan where activities were needed."
