      "heading": "What Panopio's document did not cover",
      "id": "P009",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Panopio maintained that his certification did not address how Dep-Ed funded the activities or whether its spending was proper. He agreed that Y L S and I E C were community-relations activities, not intelligence-gathering operations. He said the reported reward amount had no relation to his document. Senator-judge Panfilo Lacson noted similar language in two Army certifications. Panopio denied coordinating with Colonel Carlos Sangdaan and attributed the resemblance to common military doctrine and reporting formats."
    },
