      "heading": "What happens next",
      "id": "P010",
      "kind": "outro",
      "text": "The court excused both Army witnesses. The parties remained divided over Dep-Ed collaboration, information sharing, and the certifications' later use. Prosecution counsel said attorney Michael Wesley Poa would testify first when trial resumed on September second, with a P S A representative to follow if time permitted."
